  "detail_text": "An amendment to N6449826Q5092 has been issued and closes Friday 3 April 2026. Vendors must submit the below in order to be considered for award. 2. Price Proposal: CLIN 0001. INCLUDED WITH YOUR PROPOSAL, PLEASE PROVIDE ANY PAST EXPERIENCE, INSTRUCTOR QUALIFICATIONS/EXPERIENCE TO TEACH THE CLASS AND PLAN FOR PROVIDING ACCESS TO THE CERTIFICATION TESTS. AWARDEE MUST HAVE SCRUM.ORG CERTIFICATION OR AN EQUIVALENT INDUSTRY-RECOGNIZED CERTIFICATION IS ACCEPTABLE LIKE FROM SCRUM INC. PLEASE PROVIDE THIS INFORMATION WITH YOUR PROPOSAL, FAILURE TO SUBMIT WILL CLASSIFY THE PROPOSAL AS UNACCEPTABLE.",
